<title>USA: Lyndhurst Twp., N.J., $706,000 won by Fleet Securities. [CORRECTED 17:01 GMT]</title>
<headline>Lyndhurst Twp., N.J., $706,000 won by Fleet Securities. [CORRECTED 17:01 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects winner of capital bonds from Ryan Beck to Fleet Securities in headline and text.)</p>
<p>Fleet Securities said it won 706,000 of Lyndhurst Twp., N.J., water capital bonds, 1996.</p>
